menu "Product secure storage"

    config PRODUCT_STORAGE_REQUIRE_HMAC_NVS_ENCRYPTION
        bool "Require factory-provisioned HMAC NVS encryption"
        depends on SOC_HMAC_SUPPORTED
        default n
        help
            Encrypt the product credential NVS partition with XTS-AES keys
            derived from an already-provisioned HMAC_UP eFuse key. The normal
            firmware never generates or burns the key and fails closed if the
            key or its read/write/purpose protections are missing. Keep this
            disabled for development builds without provisioned eFuse.

    config PRODUCT_STORAGE_NVS_HMAC_KEY_ID
        int "Dedicated NVS HMAC eFuse key ID"
        depends on PRODUCT_STORAGE_REQUIRE_HMAC_NVS_ENCRYPTION
        range 0 5
        default 4
        help
            Dedicated HMAC key slot for product NVS encryption. It must not be
            shared with the device identity, Secure Boot, Flash Encryption, or
            any other purpose. The reference production profiles reserve key
            ID 4 and use a different reviewed slot for device identity.

endmenu
